                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba14cdfa-c46b-4755-b95f-26ed4127096a",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcdb51ec-2973-3b71-aaae-62e4e65f1c66",
                        "source_sense_id": "597abde0-5c8f-3ae7-ab4b-327034faf624",
                        "target_lang_word": "alder",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alder",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "213ad7cd-ea96-3f40-874d-813c92e27bb8",
                                        "entry_id": "5cc9055c-5ba4-3a92-bbf1-60f1709d3424",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several trees or shrubs of the genus Alnus, belonging to the birch family."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55ffc703-a296-46e3-ba2f-20dcfd5bb029",
                                                "sense_id": "213ad7cd-ea96-3f40-874d-813c92e27bb8",
                                                "text": "I’ve known ere now an interfering branch / Of alder catch my lifted axe behind me. / But that was in the woods, to hold my hand / From striking at another alder’s roots, / And that was, as I say, an alder branch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7674aabf-8484-4800-b361-b81a07a6f0a8",
                                                "sense_id": "213ad7cd-ea96-3f40-874d-813c92e27bb8",
                                                "text": "Have a tree or two the witches particularly like, such as the alder, larch, cypress and hemlock; then, to counteract any possible evil effects, there must be a holly, yew, hazel, elder, mountain ash or juniper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bb01188-9527-4523-b42f-b4fb79fdc19b",
                                                "sense_id": "213ad7cd-ea96-3f40-874d-813c92e27bb8",
                                                "text": "That's what the tiercel was doing when I found him again in the alder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "alder",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f54c3da-674c-3330-a17a-f752caef734b",
                                        "entry_id": "2782df8b-20d7-3e58-8a8a-75f5f3477d4a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alderman or alderwoman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "181dd52f-83a6-499a-b2e9-9296dd5f202e",
                                                "sense_id": "2f54c3da-674c-3330-a17a-f752caef734b",
                                                "text": "Almost immediately, city alders contacted the campaign to negotiate an ordinance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "962ce91f-3c61-437e-93ca-1f7635761663",
                                                "sense_id": "2f54c3da-674c-3330-a17a-f752caef734b",
                                                "text": "Chicago's mayor Edward Kennelly, the city alders, and many white Chicagoans opposed this siting plan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c4bd8aa-0b11-4e68-b3ec-af439235e472",
                                                "sense_id": "2f54c3da-674c-3330-a17a-f752caef734b",
                                                "text": "After three years as Ward 1 alder, Sarah Eidelson ’12 will leave city government at the end of the year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6e2ca7d-5f75-4345-9e9b-441a9c5dd178",
                        "source_entry_id": "bcdb51ec-2973-3b71-aaae-62e4e65f1c66",
                        "source_sense_id": "597abde0-5c8f-3ae7-ab4b-327034faf624",
                        "target_lang_word": "aulnaie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aulnaie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40317063-2c4b-3725-8146-a0e78c92d5f8",
                                        "entry_id": "5f1edab9-3f30-37ea-ab16-bed64aa8da51",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Type de végétation dominée par des aulnes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Phytosociologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8533b48-653b-44d0-9bcb-71fa8e2d4117",
                                                "sense_id": "40317063-2c4b-3725-8146-a0e78c92d5f8",
                                                "text": "Puis Jean-Baptiste s’avisa qu’il devrait bien profiter de leur barque pour relever un cordeau, tendu depuis le matin dans la morte. Sa nacelle était attachée tout au fond de l’étang, à une vieille aulnaie qu’ils connaissaient bien, trop loin pour qu’il allât la chercher, à cette heure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92dfb153-1a9e-425d-bfb5-29d9d367c3f9",
                                                "sense_id": "40317063-2c4b-3725-8146-a0e78c92d5f8",
                                                "text": "Y sont particulièrement choyées, car rares, ses pelouses calcaires, ses mares temporaires de type méditerranéen, ainsi que ses aulnaies et frênaies alluviales."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1974b47-ed60-4858-8f58-be09f06a2ba4",
                                                "sense_id": "40317063-2c4b-3725-8146-a0e78c92d5f8",
                                                "text": "Le site de la Jalle regroupe tous les milieux dont elles ont besoin. Des petites mares forestières dans l’aulnaie pour hiberner : elles s’enfouissent dans la vase tout l’hiver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9976c9b4-125d-41da-9a93-a9e21fec563b",
                                                "sense_id": "40317063-2c4b-3725-8146-a0e78c92d5f8",
                                                "text": "Vient ensuite une phase de stabilisation des principaux groupements forestiers, voire une reconquête des aulnaies, pouvant traduire une déprise humaine, bien observée sur le terrain avec le net recul de la densité de sites archéologiques au cours du IVᵉ siècle avant notre ère."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
